@startuml update-flow
!include _theme.puml

title Changing a machine — the everyday loop

start
:Edit the description\n(gisnix configure, or by hand);
:gisnix update;
:gisnix builds the new system;
if (Builds and activates cleanly?) then (yes)
  :A new generation is live;
  stop
else (no)
  :Nothing changed on the\nrunning machine;
  :Fix the description\nand try again;
  stop
endif
@enduml
